<title>UK: Baden Wuerttemburg sets 300 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Baden Wuerttemburg sets 300 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE OF BADEN-WUERTTEMBURG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     *6.0 PCT  MATURITY  **23.MAR.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.625    PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    99.625    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST 10-YEARS THEN STEPS UP TO 7.625 PCT</p>
<p>	     **PUT ON 23.MAR.07</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT STG   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR BUND</p>
